Schengen-specific travel information

Because the journey is from Dublin, Ireland to the Schengen Area, explain relevant border/travel considerations.

Verify current requirements including:

- Passport requirements
- Immigration/passport control
- Schengen entry rules
- ETIAS/EES status if relevant at the travel date
- Whether any visa requirement applies based on the traveller information provided

Do not assume Ireland is part of Schengen.

Use current official EU/government sources.

