- Sightseeing
- Food
- Weather
- Walkability
- Flight convenience
- Value
- Weekend suitability

Then give an overall score out of 10 and briefly explain whether this destination is genuinely a strong choice for a 2-night weekend from Dublin or whether another Schengen city would be substantially better.